				},
				{
					"id": 402201203,
					"content": "沒關係的，義剛，身體也很重要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "明妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201204,
					"content": "雖然沒能一起參加比賽，但至少還有這張合照。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛拉尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201205,
					"content": "覺得有遺憾的話，下屆比賽再來吧。到時候拿個金牌回去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希諾寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201206,
					"content": "咳…下一次我一定要咳…來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "湯義剛"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201207,
					"content": "你放輕鬆一點吧，下次可別感冒啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛拉尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201208,
					"content": "隊長，以防萬一，下一次我也要跟著一起訓練，至少還可以多一個替補隊員。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛拉尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201209,
					"content": "那就約好了，下一次大家還要再聚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
